{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20291","headline":"白头吟 · 张籍","name":"白头吟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"请君漆上琴，弹我白头吟。\n忆昔君前娇笑语，两情宛转如萦素。\n宫中爲我起高楼，更开花池种芳树。\n春天百草秋始衰，弃我不待白头时。\n罗襦玉珥色未暗，今朝已道不相宜。\n扬州青铜作明镜，暗中持照不见影。\n人心回互自无穷，眼前好恶那能定。\n君恩已去若再返，菖蒲花开月长满。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20291.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20291","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}